ew controls with full left/right/up/down control &amp; all levels modified for the new controls<br>- Supports even 4 players on a single keyboard (old-school style) and any combination of keyboard and controllers<br>- Enhanced, above Full-HD graphics.<br>- 77 Achievements<br>- Cloud save &amp; Steam trading cards<br>- Leaderboards<br><br>Follow us:<br>Facebook - <br>Twitter - <br>Blog - ",
